    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Two feet of blade and a grip for one hand. The sidearm of people who do their fighting in corridors, stairwells and crowded markets — courier guards, dock crews, anyone who has ever had to turn around fast. Cheap to make and cheaper to replace.</p><p>Quick, close, honest.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Light, finesse-friendly. Pairs with a second weapon or a buckler. No signature ability.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 + 2 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(blade)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Reach:</strong> Melee</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T3</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Circuited (+2). A closed circuit of sigils; it answers one hand.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>+2 to hit and +2 damage</strong> with this weapon (the hit bonus is read from the weapon you swing).</li>\n  <li>Grade raises it to <strong>Tier III</strong> · attuned (one slot).</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
  },
